    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "V'aizilaeli v'ali'ki'lania nyanza ya Shamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“V'awi'le V'aizilaeli v'asu'v'e ku' nnuma, v'atu'u'le nkambi' ha mbele ya kaya ya Pi-hahiloti, hagati' na kaya ya Migidoli na nyanza ya Shamu. V'atu'u'le nkambi' ha ngiligili ya nyanza matanda na kaya ya Baal-sefoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Falao akwiganika ati', ‘V'aizilaeli v'enav'o v'ali'tuka mugati' na nsi', ku'nguno ya ibalangu' lyav'apotaga ku'v'i'ta.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanne nku'gu'v'ezya moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, nawe aku'mulondezya. Nanne nku'pandi'ka lu'kumo ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Falao na v'asilikale v'akwe v'ose. Haho V'amisili v'alamanye ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.” Nav'o V'aizilaeli v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Falao, mutemi wa Misili, aho wigagwa ku'v'a V'aizilaeli v'apeelaga, mweni'ki'li' na v'akumba v'akwe v'agalu'zyaga ndaka yav'o ku' V'aizilaeli na ku'yomba, “Kwav'ezya ki' mu ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'aye v'aleke ku'ku'tu'mami'la hangi'?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Falao wiv'angaga mukokoteni gwakwe gwa wu'lu'gu' gwa ku'kweswa na falasi na wawu'kaga na v'asilikale v'akwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasolaga mikokoteni magana mukaga misoga ku' wu'lu'gu', haki'mo na mikokoteni i'zyo zingi' zyose zya wu'lu'gu' zya V'amisili, na v'ahanya v'a v'asilikale mu mikokoteni zyeni'zyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, haho Falao wav'alondezyaga V'aizilaeli ku'nguno ndi' v'awu'kaga ku' wu'gaazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'asilikale v'a Ki'misili haki'mo na falasi na mikokoteni zyav'o zyose zya wu'lu'gu' na v'asilikale v'a ku'liina falasi, v'av'alondezyaga V'aizilaeli, nav'o v'av'apandi'ki'laga aho v'av'age v'atu'u'lile nkambi' yav'o ha ngiligili na nyanza, aho hav'age ha mbele na Pi-hahiloti, matanda na Baal-sefoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'aizilaeli aho v'ikev'elaga, v'awonaga kasinaga Falao izile na v'asilikale v'akwe. Haho v'agwaga magongofuka, na v'amuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'amuwi'laga Mose ati', “Vihe, ku' Misili kwali' ku'du'hu' viv'i'mbi' vya ku'ku'gelani'la mpaka waku'leta kwize ku'fwi'le ku'no ku' ibalangu'? Ku' ki' waku'fumya ku' Misili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vihe, ndi' ku'kaku'wi'lile muhayo gwenu'gu' ku'fuma ku' Misili? Ndi' kwaku'wi'la u'ku'leke kwendeleye ku'v'a v'asese v'a V'amisili. Yali' yi'li' visoga ku' wiswe ku'v'atu'mami'la V'amisili ku'ki'la ku'fwi'la ku'no ku' ibalangu'!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muleke kogoha! Inywe jaami mwi'me hi'gi'! Walelo muku'wu'wona wu'pi'zya wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. V'enav'a V'amisili muli'v'awona walelo, mukasye muv'awone hangi' nhananhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'mwigu'mi'la, na inywe muku'hu'li'ka sele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Ku' ki' u'li'ndi'li'la ene? V'awi'le V'aizilaeli v'endeleye ku' mbele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanho u'wu'sye mulanga gwako, na ku'golola mukono gwako ha igu'lya na nyanza. Minzi' gakwiki'ga u'ku' na u'ku', nav'o V'aizilaeli v'aku'v'i'ta hagati' na nyanza ha nsi' nyu'mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanne nku'v'av'ezya V'amisili ku'v'a na myoyo milambu, ki'gele v'ingi'le mu nyanza ku'nguno ya ku'mulondezya. Haho nku'pandi'ka lu'kumo ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Falao na v'asilikale v'akwe v'ose, mikokoteni zya wu'lu'gu' zya ku'kweswa na falasi, haki'mo na v'aliina falasi v'akwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o V'amisili v'aku'manya ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, aho nku'v'a napandi'ka lu'kumo ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Falao, mikokoteni zyakwe zya wu'lu'gu', na v'aliina falasi v'akwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' malaika wamwa Mulungu u'yo wav'age ali'yu'mba ha mbele na v'asilikale v'a V'aizilaeli, wawu'kaga na kwikala ku' nnuma yav'o. Hangi' i'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' lyahafumaga ha mbele yav'o, na lyi'maga ha nnuma yav'o, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na likalaga hagati' ya v'asilikale v'a Ki'misili na madale ga V'aizilaeli. Ilunde lyeni'lo lyav'aletelaga V'amisili giti, sumbwa ku' V'aizilaeli wu'ziku'pee ndi' li'v'amu'li'ki'lile. Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'akiegelile wu'ziku'pee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wagololaga mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na nyanza, nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu waletaga muyaga muhanya ku'fuma mu ki'ya, nago gwagatenkaga minzi' ga mu nyanza wu'ziku'pee, nago minzi' gihegaga na ku'leka nsi' nyu'mu. Minzi' gikumingaga lwandi' u'u'lu' na u'u'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene V'aizilaeli v'av'i'taga hagati' na nyanza ha nsi' nyu'mu, na minzi' ndi' gihegaga na ku'v'ezya igelele, lwandi' lwav'o lwa ku' mumoso na lwa ku' mulyi'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o V'amisili v'av'alondezyaga V'aizilaeli, ku'v'i'ti'la ha nsi' nyu'mu i'yo ndi' yi'li' hagati' na nyanza. V'av'alondezyaga haki'mo na falasi zyav'o, mikokoteni zyav'o zya wu'lu'gu', na v'aliina falasi v'av'o v'ose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'age mu ikingilima, Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'fuma ku' igu'lya wali'lolaga idale lya v'asilikale lya V'amisili, ku'fuma mu ilunde lya moto i'lo li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi', na ku'li'hahya muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wagapantamyaga maguludumu ga mikokoteni zyav'o, na ku'nguno yeni'yo gayaga ku' lu'duko lu'hanya. Hohene V'amisili ndi' v'ayomba ati', “Ku'v'apeele V'aizilaeli! Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'v'igu'mi'la.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Wu'sya mukono gwako ha igu'lya na nyanza, ki'gele minzi' gasu'v'e na ku'v'anyumi'zya V'amisili, haki'mo na mikokoteni zyav'o zyose zya wu'lu'gu' na v'aliina falasi v'av'o.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wawu'syaga mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na nyanza, na yav'age mu ikingilima nyanza yasu'v'i'laga kikali'le chayo. Haho V'amisili v'agemaga ku'gapeela minzi', ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'atenkelaga mu nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Minzi' gav'anyumi'zyaga v'aliina falasi v'ose na mikokoteni zyose zya wu'lu'gu', na v'asilikale v'amwa Falao av'o ndi' v'av'alondile V'aizilaeli, v'ose v'afwi'laga mwenu'mo. Akapu'lu'gu'kile ninga yu'mo mugati' nav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi V'aizilaeli v'asangwa v'av'i'taga hagati' na nyanza ha nsi' nyu'mu, u'ku' minzi' gi'maga ki'ti' igelele ku' lwandi' lwav'o lwa mukono gwa ku' mulyi'la na gwa ku' mumoso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
